                    <table width="80%" align="center" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <i style="font-size:8pt; color:red;"><b>Note:- For activities or ratings of instruments falling under the purview of Financial Sector Regulators other than SEBI, the grievance / dispute redressal mechanisms and investor protection mechanisms provided by SEBI shall not be available.</b></i>

