                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                                        <b> Adequate </b>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                            <span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:12px !important">­</span>SISL has bank facilities comprising of bank guarantee and overdraft facilities, which are used for margin requirements. The bank guarantees are almost fully utilized, while overdraft facilities have low utilization level. The company had maintained unencumbered cash and cash equivalents of Rs 522.77&nbsp; Cr. as on March 31, 2026.&nbsp; Acuité believes the liquidity position will remain adequate in the near to medium term.
                                        </td>
